{"route":"/digital-transformation-iiot/","file":"digital-transformation-iiot.html","title":"Digital Transformation & IIoT - TechnoAi","description":"Accelerate digital transformation by connecting assets, machines, sensors, and enterprise systems into one intelligent operational ecosystem. Our Industrial","canonical":"https://technoai.ae/digital-transformation-iiot/","ogImage":"https://technoai.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/home-page-web.webp","kind":"page","date":"2026-03-23T15:47:07+04:00","hero":{"title":"DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION &amp; IIoT","lead":[],"buttons":[],"image":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DT_Cover.jpg"},"sections":[{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Transform Industrial Operations with Intelligent Connected Systems"},{"t":"p","html":"Accelerate digital transformation by connecting assets, machines, sensors, and enterprise systems into one intelligent operational ecosystem. Our Industrial Internet of Things (IIoT) solutions provide real-time visibility, automation, analytics, and data-driven decision-making to improve efficiency, reliability, and operational performance across industrial environments. IIoT connects industrial assets to enable monitoring, analysis, and process optimisation as part of Industry 4.0 initiatives."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"grid","items":[{"title":"Industrial Connectivity","text":["Connect machines, sensors, PLCs, SCADA systems, and field devices into a unified digital infrastructure for real-time operational visibility."],"list":[],"icon":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"svg2388\" xml:space=\"preserve\" width=\"682.66669\" height=\"682.66669\" viewBox=\"0 0 682.66669 682.66669\"><defs id=\"defs2392\"><clipPath clipPathUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" id=\"clipPath2406\"><path d=\"M 0,512 H 512 V 0 H 0 Z\" id=\"path2404\"></path></clipPath></defs><g id=\"g2394\" transform=\"matrix(1.3333333,0,0,-1.3333333,0,682.66667)\"><g id=\"g2396\" transform=\"translate(256,248)\"><path d=\"M 0,