"INDUSTRIAL DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Turning Operational Data into Business Intelligence"},{"t":"p","html":"Digital transformation is more than adopting new technology—it's about creating connected operations that improve productivity, reduce downtime, and support faster, data-driven decision-making. Industrial IoT enables organisations to connect physical assets with digital systems, providing continuous visibility into equipment, processes, and infrastructure.<br><br>TechnoAI delivers integrated digital transformation solutions that combine industrial connectivity, intelligent monitoring, automation, analytics, and system integration to help organisations modernise operations while building a scalable foundation for Industry 4.0 initiatives."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"BENEFITS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Key Benefits"},{"t":"ul","items":["Real-time operational visibility","Connected industrial assets","Improved decision-making","Reduced operational downtime","Predictive maintenance capabilities","Enhanced resource utilisation","IT &amp; OT system integration","Scalable Industry 4.0 readiness"],"ordered":false},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Digital Transformation Portfolio"},{"t":"p","html":"Our digital transformation portfolio combines Industrial IoT platforms, edge computing, data acquisition, industrial gateways, automation technologies, cloud integration, and analytics solutions to modernise industrial operations and infrastructure."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"APPLICATIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Ideal For"},{"t":"icon","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512.016 512.016\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g><path d=\"M463.295 76.593a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-9.736-11.411l-16.191 13.813a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 9.736 11.411zM430.592 231.665v9.229c0 4.142 3.357 7.5 7.5 7.5s7.5-3